{
  "title": "An agent records a narrated demo with aidemo",
  "targetLengthSeconds": 150,
  "captions": {
    "style": "none",
    "track": true
  },
  "hold": {
    "mode": "freeze"
  },
  "attention": {
    "color": "#8cc8ff",
    "cursorClear": true
  },
  "voice": {
    "pronounce": {
      "aidemo": "A.I. demo",
      "TTS": "T.T.S.",
      "JSON": "jason"
    }
  },
  "output": {
    "chapters": true
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "title": "Title",
      "narration": "A coding agent records a narrated demo with aidemo, from one prompt to a finished video with captions. This video was made the same {{@next}}way.",
      "voice": {
        "pronounce": {
          "records": "re-cords"
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "goto",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/deck/01-title.html"
        },
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2000
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".lede"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2500
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prompt",
      "title": "Prompt",
      "narration": "It starts with one {{@prompt}}prompt to Claude Code: the page, the steps to show, and the length, with the local voice and a caption track. The agent answers with a {{@storyboard}}storyboard, through the record-demo skill or the aidemo MCP {{@next}}server.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "pre.prompt"
          },
          "holdMs": 7000,
          "anchor": "prompt"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 9000
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prompt-storyboard"
          },
          "holdMs": 3500,
          "anchor": "storyboard"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2000
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "storyboard",
      "title": "Storyboard",
      "narration": "The storyboard is plain JSON that you can edit. Each scene pairs {{@narration}}narration, what the voice says, with {{@actions}}actions, what the browser does, replayed the same way on every take. The {{@captions}}captions setting asks for a subtitle track, so no text is burned into the {{@next}}frame.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "pre.json"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3500
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#storyboard-narration"
          },
          "holdMs": 2500,
          "anchor": "narration"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1400
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#storyboard-actions"
          },
          "holdMs": 4500,
          "anchor": "actions"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 4000
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#storyboard-captions"
          },
          "holdMs": 4500,
          "anchor": "captions"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 4000
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "probe",
      "title": "Probe",
      "narration": "Before spending a take, the agent runs aidemo probe. It drives the page without a voice and checks every selector. With the {{@golden}}golden flag, a {{@changed}}changed page fails the probe {{@next}}first.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "pre"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 7500
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#probe-golden"
          },
          "holdMs": 2500,
          "anchor": "golden"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 400
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#probe-unchanged"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "changed"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 400
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "render",
      "title": "Render",
      "narration": "Then aidemo render runs the whole pipeline: the local {{@kokoro}}Kokoro voice, a headless take on a fresh profile, {{@captions}}captions derived from the script, and the final video. With the {{@strict}}strict flag, any compose warning fails the {{@next}}run.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "pre"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2500
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#render-voice"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "kokoro"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2600
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#render-captions"
          },
          "holdMs": 3500,
          "anchor": "captions"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3400
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#render-strict"
          },
          "holdMs": 3500,
          "anchor": "strict"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "edit",
      "title": "Narration edit",
      "narration": "Now the review. One line in the second scene reads {{@awkwardly}}awkwardly, so the agent {{@edits}}edits it. Only the narration changes, and the browser actions stay as they {{@next}}were.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "pre.removed"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3000
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "pre.removed"
          },
          "holdMs": 2000,
          "anchor": "awkwardly"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 800
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "pre.added"
          },
          "holdMs": 5000,
          "anchor": "edits"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3600
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "revoice",
      "title": "Re-voice",
      "narration": "So nothing is recorded again. aidemo voice {{@voices}}voices only the edited scene, aidemo captions with the {{@offline}}offline flag rebuilds its timing, and aidemo compose {{@cuts}}cuts the new narration into the existing {{@next}}take.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "main > pre:nth-of-type(1)"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1800
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#revoice-reused"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "voices"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2600
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#revoice-offline"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "offline"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2200
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#revoice-span"
          },
          "holdMs": 3500,
          "anchor": "cuts"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "environment",
      "title": "Environment",
      "narration": "Two settings keep the voice and the captions on the machine. First, {{@remove}}remove the three OpenAI variables and {{@select}}select the local voice. Then {{@check}}check the repository's dot env file, which aidemo loads over the {{@next}}environment.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "main > p:first-of-type"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3800
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#env-unset"
          },
          "holdMs": 2500,
          "anchor": "remove"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1400
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#env-export"
          },
          "holdMs": 2000,
          "anchor": "select"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1000
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#env-grep"
          },
          "holdMs": 4500,
          "anchor": "check"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2800
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "login",
      "title": "Login",
      "narration": "Second, for an app behind a login, run aidemo {{@login}}login once to sign in on the recording profile, then {{@quit}}quit Chrome completely before the take. Chrome locks a profile that is {{@next}}open.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "main > p:first-of-type"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2600
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#login-command"
          },
          "holdMs": 3500,
          "anchor": "login"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3000
        },
        {
          "op": "callout",
          "target": {
            "selector": "main > p:first-of-type"
          },
          "text": "Quit Chrome before the take",
          "holdMs": 4500,
          "anchor": "quit"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3200
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "title": "Result",
      "narration": "Here is the {{@result}}result, playing as it was rendered. The file contains a {{@caption}}caption track that viewers can turn on, and the narration was produced on this machine, without any request over the {{@next}}network.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1000
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#result"
          },
          "holdMs": 3500,
          "anchor": "result"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3000
        },
        {
          "op": "callout",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#result"
          },
          "text": "Subtitle track, off until the viewer turns it on",
          "holdMs": 5000,
          "anchor": "caption"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 6400
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          },
          "anchor": "next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "title": "Close",
      "narration": "That is the loop: a {{@prompt}}prompt, a {{@storyboard}}storyboard, a {{@probe}}probe, a {{@render}}render, one {{@edited}}edited line, and a new {{@voice}}voice without recording again. The storyboard is committed beside the package, so the next render starts from the same file.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "h1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1800
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".loop li:nth-child(1)"
          },
          "holdMs": 700,
          "style": {
            "shape": "ring"
          },
          "anchor": "prompt"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".loop li:nth-child(2)"
          },
          "holdMs": 700,
          "style": {
            "shape": "ring"
          },
          "anchor": "storyboard"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".loop li:nth-child(3)"
          },
          "holdMs": 700,
          "style": {
            "shape": "ring"
          },
          "anchor": "probe"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".loop li:nth-child(4)"
          },
          "holdMs": 700,
          "style": {
            "shape": "ring"
          },
          "anchor": "render"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".loop li:nth-child(5)"
          },
          "holdMs": 1200,
          "style": {
            "shape": "ring"
          },
          "anchor": "edited"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1000
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".loop li:nth-child(6)"
          },
          "holdMs": 2500,
          "style": {
            "shape": "ring"
          },
          "anchor": "voice"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 2500
        },
        {
          "op": "moveTo",
          "target": {
            "selector": "a.next"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 3500
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
